{"suttaId":"tha-ap119","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-i","vriCode":"s0510m1.mul","paras":[5563,5590],"vripara":"57"},"segments":{"tha-ap119:0.3":"Buddhasaññakattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap119:1.1":"“Yadā vipassī lokaggo,","tha-ap119:1.2":"āyusaṅkhāramossaji;","tha-ap119:1.3":"Pathavī sampakampittha,","tha-ap119:1.4":"medanī jalamekhalā.","tha-ap119:2.1":"“Otataṃ vitthataṃ [otataṃ vitataṃ (syā.)] mayhaṃ,","tha-ap119:2.2":"suvicittavaṭaṃsakaṃ [sucicittaṃ papañcakaṃ (syā.)];","tha-ap119:2.3":"Bhavanampi pakampittha,","tha-ap119:2.4":"buddhassa āyusaṅkhaye.","tha-ap119:3.1":"“Tāso mayhaṃ samuppanno,","tha-ap119:3.2":"bhavane sampakampite;","tha-ap119:3.3":"Uppādo [uppāto (?)] nu kimatthāya,","tha-ap119:3.4":"āloko vipulo ahu.","tha-ap119:4.1":"“Vessavaṇo idhāgamma,","tha-ap119:4.2":"nibbāpesi mahājanaṃ;","tha-ap119:4.3":"Pāṇabhūte [pāṇabhutaṃ (syā.), pāṇabhūnaṃ (sī. ka.)] bhayaṃ natthi,","tha-ap119:4.4":"ekaggā hotha saṃvutā [sagāravā (syā.)].","tha-ap119:5.1":"“Aho buddho aho dhammo, aho no satthu sampadā;","tha-ap119:5.3":"Yasmiṃ uppajjamānamhi,","tha-ap119:5.4":"pathavī [paṭhavī (sī. syā.)] sampakampati.","tha-ap119:6.1":"“Buddhānubhāvaṃ kittetvā,","tha-ap119:6.2":"kappaṃ saggamhi modahaṃ;","tha-ap119:6.3":"Avasesesu kappesu,","tha-ap119:6.4":"kusalaṃ caritaṃ [karitaṃ (sī. syā.), kāritaṃ (ka.)] mayā.","tha-ap119:7.1":"“Ekanavutito kappe,","tha-ap119:7.2":"yaṃ saññamalabhiṃ tadā;","tha-ap119:7.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi,","tha-ap119:7.4":"buddhasaññāyidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap119:8.1":"“Ito cuddasakappamhi,","tha-ap119:8.2":"rājā āsiṃ patāpavā;","tha-ap119:8.3":"Samito nāma nāmena,","tha-ap119:8.4":"cakkavattī mahabbalo.","tha-ap119:9.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe …","tha-ap119:9.3":"kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap119:10.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā buddhasaññako thero imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap119:11.1":"Buddhasaññakattherassāpadānaṃ sattamaṃ."},"unsure":["tha-ap119:5.1"],"attha":{"book":"Ap-a","bookName":"Apadāna-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0510a.att","from":2874,"to":2875,"paras":[{"para":2874,"vripara":"57","refs":["tha-ap119:1"],"lines":["So aparabhāge attano pubbakammaṃ saritvā somanassajāto pubbacaritāpadānaṃ pakāsento <b>yadā vipassī lokaggo</b>tiādimāha.","<b>Āyusaṅkhāramossajjī</b>ti ā samantato yunoti pāleti satteti āyu, āyussa saṅkhāro rāsibhāvo āyusaṅkhāro, taṃ āyusaṅkhāraṃ ossajji pariccaji jahāsīti attho.","Tasmiṃ āyusaṅkhāravossajjane.","Jalamekhalāsāgarodakamekhalāsahitā sakaladasasahassacakkavāḷapathavī kampitthāti sambandho."],"lineRefs":[["tha-ap119:1"],["tha-ap119:1"],["tha-ap119:1"],["tha-ap119:1"]]},{"para":2875,"vripara":"58","refs":["tha-ap119:2"],"lines":["<b>Otataṃ vitthataṃ mayhan</b>ti mayhaṃ bhavanaṃ otataṃ vitthataṃ cittaṃ vicittaṃ <b>suci</b> suparisuddhaṃ <b>cittaṃ</b> anekehi sattahi ratanehi vicittaṃ sobhamānaṃ <b>pakampittha</b> pakārena kampitthāti attho.","Sesaṃ sabbattha uttānamevāti."],"lineRefs":[["tha-ap119:2"],["tha-ap119:2"]]}],"wordLinks":[["tha-ap119:1.1","yadā vipassī lokaggo",0,0],["tha-ap119:2.1","cittaṃ",1,0],["tha-ap119:2.1","otataṃ vitthataṃ mayhaṃ",1,0],["tha-ap119:2.3","pakampittha",1,0]],"before":[{"para":2871,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Citakapūjakattheraapadānavaṇṇanā samattā."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":2872,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Buddhasaññakattheraapadānavaṇṇanā"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":2873,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["<b>Yadā vipassī lokaggo</b>tiādikaṃ āyasmato buddhasaññakattherassa apadānaṃ.","Ayampi purimabuddhesu katādhikāro tattha tattha bhave vivaṭṭūpanissayāni puññāni upacinanto vipassissa bhagavato kāle ekasmiṃ bhūmaṭṭhakavimāne devaputto hutvā nibbatti.","Tadā vipassī bhagavā āyusaṅkhāraṃ vossajji.","Atha sakaladasasahassilokadhātu sasāgarapabbatā pakampittha.","Tadā tassa devaputtassa bhavanampi kampittha.","Tasmiṃ khaṇe so devaputto saṃsayajāto –","“kiṃ nu kho pathavīkampāya nibbattī”ti cintetvā buddhassa āyusaṅkhāravossajjabhāvaṃ ñatvā mahāsokaṃ domanassaṃ uppādesi.","Tadā vessavaṇo mahārājā āgantvā “mā cintayitthā”ti assāsesi.","So devaputto tato cuto tena puññena devamanussesu saṃsaranto imasmiṃ buddhuppāde kulagehe nibbatto viññutaṃ patto gharāvāsaṃ pahāya pabbajitvā nacirasseva arahā ahosi."],"lineRefs":[[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[]]}]},"tika":null,"tika2":null}
